62ac94ddd560c02446b744_b1n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":" Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":" Solna","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":" 171 54","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Elektrogatan 4"},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021002114","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2021002114","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:jobtechdevelopment@arbetsformedlingen.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Arbetsförmedlingen"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.arbetsformedlingen.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://apier.arbetsformedlingen.se/#publisherJobposting"},{"@id":"https://arbetsformedlingen.se/#publisherHistoriska_annonser2"},{"@id":"https://arbetsformedlingen.se/result.rdf#publisher"},{"@id":"https://jobad-enrichments-api.jobtechdev.se/#publisherJobAd_Enrichments2"},{"@id":"https://jobed-connect-api.jobtechdev.se/#publisherJobEd_Connect2"},{"@id":"https://jobsearch.api.jobtechdev.se/#publisherJobsearch2"},{"@id":"https://jobstream.api.jobtechdev.se/#publisherJob_Stream2"},{"@id":"https://jobstream.api.jobtechdev.se/#publisherjobstream2"},{"@id":"https://links.api.jobtechdev.se/#publisherJobAd_links2"},{"@id":"https://taxonomy.api.jobtechdev.se/v1/taxonomy/#publisherTaxonomi2"}]},{"@id":"https://data.arbetsformedlingen.se/taxonomy/version/latest/query/substitutability-relations-between-occupations/substitutability-relations-between-occupations.json#about0","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://data.arbetsformedlingen.se/taxonomy/version/latest/query/substitutability-relations-between-occupations/substitutability-relations-between-occupations.json#contact"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://data.arbetsformedlingen.se/taxonomy/version/latest/query/substitutability-relations-between-occupations/substitutability-relations-between-occupations.json#distrib"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"labour market"},{"@language":"en","@value":"skill"},{"@language":"en","@value":"taxonomy"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"arbetsmarknad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"arbetsmarknadstaxonomi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"taxonomi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"yrke"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"http://atlas.jobtechdev.se"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/GOVE"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/MONTHLY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The data set describes substitutability relations between occupations. A substitutability relation can be expressed between two occupation concepts and on two levels, high (75) and low (25). A high substitutability means that there is great similarity in the work tasks between the two occupations. A low substitutability means that some of the tasks may be similar and that some kind of training program would be required to move from one occupation to the other.Occupations and the relations described above are created and continuously updated in consultation with stakeholders in the labor market. They are categorized according to SSYK, Swedish Standard Classification of Occupations, which is based on ISCO, the International Standard Classification of Occupation. The current version is SSYK 2012.. The occupation fields are produced by the Swedish Employment Service (Arbetsförmedlingen)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängden beskriver släktskap mellan yrkesbenämningar. Ett släktskap uttrycks mellan två begrepp och på två nivåer, hög (75) och låg (25). Ett högt släktskap innebär att det är stor likhet i arbetsuppgifter mellan två yrkesbenämningar. Ett lågt släktskap innebär att några av arbetsuppgifterna är lika och att någon form av utbildningsinsats skulle krävas för att övergå från det ena yrket till det andra.Yrkesbenämningarna och släktskapen i datamängden är skapade och uppdateras kontinuerligt i samråd med aktörerna på arbetsmarknaden. Yrkesbenämningarna är kategoriserade enligt SSYK, Svensk standard för yrkesklassificering som bygger på den internationella yrkesklassificeringen ISCO, International Standard Classification of Occupation. Den nuvarande versionen är SSYK-2012."}],"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021002114"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"https://www.geonames.org/6695072/european-union.html"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Substitutability relations between occupations"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Släktskap mellan yrkesbenämningar"}],"http://entryscape.com/terms/servedByDataService":{"@id":"https://taxonomy.api.jobtechdev.se/v1/taxonomy/#dataserviceTaxonomi"}},{"@id":"https://data.arbetsformedlingen.se/taxonomy/version/latest/query/substitutability-relations-between-occupations/substitutability-relations-between-occupations.json#contact","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Arbetsförmedlingen","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:225fded025b758a8c3d9ed35433dedaed4a0b670c962ac94ddd560c02446b744_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailTo:opendata@arbetsformedlingen.se"}},{"@id":"https://data.arbetsformedlingen.se/taxonomy/version/latest/query/substitutability-relations-between-occupations/substitutability-relations-between-occupations.json#distrib","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://taxonomy.api.jobtechdev.se/v1/taxonomy/#dataserviceTaxonomi"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://data.jobtechdev.se/taxonomy/version/31/query/substitutability-relations-between-occupations/substitutability-relations-between-occupations.json"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://data.jobtechdev.se/taxonomy/version/31/query/substitutability-relations-between-occupations/substitutability-relations-between-occupations.json"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The distribution consists of a JSON-encoded file with a list of occupations nested under data and concepts. Each occupation is represented by an object with the fields id (concept ID), preferred_label (name) and type (concept type), as well as the lists substituted_by (occupations that can substitute this occupation) and substitutes (occupations that this occupation can substitute). Each related occupation has the fields id, preferred_label, type and substitutability_percentage (degree of substitutability, 25 for low or 75 for high)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Distributionen består av en JSON-kodad fil med en lista av yrkesbenämningar nästlade under data och concepts. Varje yrkesbenämning representeras av ett objekt med fälten id (begrepps-id), preferred_label (namn) och type (begreppstyp), samt listorna substituted_by (yrken som kan ersätta detta yrke) och substitutes (yrken som detta yrke kan ersätta). Varje relaterad yrkesbenämning har fälten id, preferred_label, type och substitutability_percentage (släktskapsgrad, 25 för låg eller 75 för hög)."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:language":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"}],"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Substitutability relations between occupations"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Släktskap mellan yrkesbenämningar"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availabili